BEGIN:VEVENT
IMAGE;VALUE=URI;DISPLAY=BADGE;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://eadn-wc02-10923896
 .nxedge.io/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Tandem-Bikes.jpg
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://eadn-wc02-10923896.nxedge.io/wp-content/u
 ploads/2024/04/Tandem-Bikes.jpg
UID:_evwbKEOqHv1q3r5Qm2YM
SUMMARY:Monthly Tandem Bike Riding with Achilles International - August 202
	6
DTSTAMP:20260815T032440Z
DTSTART:20260815T080000Z
DESCRIPTION:Ride in Tandem – Inclusive Cycling with The Lighthouse and Achi
	lles International\nDon’t miss the thrill of our upcoming tandem bike ride
	 days! In partnership with Achilles International\, we’re bringing togethe
	r riders of all abilities for a fully inclusive tandem cycling workout\, f
	ollowed by a relaxed breakfast social to refuel and connect. \nWhere: Stud
	e Park – 1031 Stude Street\, Houston\, TX 77007 \nWhen: Usually every Satu
	rday of the month\, 8:00–10:00 AM. Check our events calendar for exact dat
	es. \nPLEASE NOTE: If you are already an Achilles member\, please register
	 by Friday at 8:00 AM. If you are not yet an Achilles member\, please comp
	lete their free membership form here: https://achillesinternational.roster
	fy.com/register \nFor questions regarding tandem rides\, please contact Mi
	chaela with Achilles Houston at 346-819-7465. \nWant to make an even bigge
	r impact? Volunteers are needed to help guide riders\, assist with equipme
	nt\, and keep the event running smoothly. Whether you’re an experienced cy
	clist or just eager to lend a hand\, your support helps ensure a safe\, fu
	n\, and welcoming experience for all participants. \nFor more details or t
	o volunteer\, call 713-284-8424\, email youthadultservices@houstonlighthou
	se.org\, or visit the Achilles International Houston website. \nREGISTER H
	ERE. \n \n\nhttps://houstonlighthouse.org/event/monthly-tandem-bike-riding
	-with-achilles-international-august-2026/2026-08-15/\n\nFrom Houston Light
	house
URL:https://houstonlighthouse.org/event/monthly-tandem-bike-riding-with-ach
	illes-international-august-2026/2026-08-15/
LOCATION:Stude Park\, 1031 Stude Street\, Houston\, TX\, 77007
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:houston-lighthouse
CATEGORIES:Houston Lighthouse
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT2H
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
IMAGE;VALUE=URI;DISPLAY=BADGE;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://eadn-wc02-10923896.
 nxedge.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/BVI-Fair-2026.png
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://eadn-wc02-10923896.nxedge.io/wp-content/up
 loads/2026/07/BVI-Fair-2026.png
UID:usineAJoM5Y284Eo5dpfZ
SUMMARY:BVI Back to School Resource Fair 2026
DTSTAMP:20260815T032440Z
DTSTART:20260815T090000Z
DESCRIPTION:Join us at The Lighthouse of Houston on August 15 from 9:00 AM 
	to 12:30 PM for our 2026 Transition and Resource Fair—a dynamic\, hands-on
	 event designed for blind and visually impaired youth ages 14–22. This exc
	iting fair empowers students with essential life skills including self-adv
	ocacy\, confidence building\, job readiness\, and computer literacy. Atten
	dees will explore adaptive technology\, orientation and mobility training\
	, and even get creative with accessible arts and crafts. The event also fe
	atures a wide range of community and government resources—all at no cost. 
	Plus\, students will receive free BVI accessible school supplies and a bac
	kpack! We are grateful to our amazing sponsors who help make this impactfu
	l event possible. \nStudents – Click here to register. \nVendors – Click h
	ere to register. \n \n\nhttps://houstonlighthouse.org/event/bvi-back-to-sc
	hool-resource-fair-2026/\n\nFrom Houston Lighthouse
URL:https://houstonlighthouse.org/event/bvi-back-to-school-resource-fair-20
	26/
LOCATION:The Lighthouse of Houston\, 3602 West Dallas\, Houston\, TX\, 7701
	9\, United States
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:houston-lighthouse
CATEGORIES:Houston Lighthouse
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT4H
END:VEVENT
