UID:SJiovb5GYeTsVdkPtx_5X
SUMMARY:The Lighthouse Peer Support Group - Monthly
DTSTAMP:20260815T032440Z
DTSTART:20260818T100000Z
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a new monthly in-person education and support group
	 for individuals who are blind or have low vision. This social and informa
	tive gathering takes place every 3rd Tuesday of the month and offers a wel
	coming space to connect\, share experiences\, and learn about local resour
	ces available to the blind and low vision (BLV) community. \nWhether you’r
	e seeking helpful information\, looking to build friendships\, or want to 
	share your own experiences\, this group is here to support and empower you
	. \nTime: 10:00 AM – 11:30 AM\nLocation: The Lighthouse of Houston Boardro
	om \nAll are welcome. Come join the conversation and help grow a strong\, 
	connected BLV community.\n\nhttps://houstonlighthouse.org/event/the-lighth
	ouse-peer-support-group/2026-08-18/\n\nFrom Houston Lighthouse
URL:https://houstonlighthouse.org/event/the-lighthouse-peer-support-group/2
	026-08-18/
LOCATION:The Lighthouse of Houston\, 3602 West Dallas\, Houston\, TX\, 7701
	9\, United States
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:houston-lighthouse
CATEGORIES:Houston Lighthouse
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT2H
END:VEVENT
